# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Eine SQD-Schätzung mit Orbitaloptimierung verbessern für die neueste Version der Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization"
msgstr "Eine SQD-Schätzung mit Orbitaloptimierung verbessern"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/optimize-orbitals.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) approximates a ground-state energy by\n"
"diagonalizing the Hamiltonian in a fixed subspace of electronic configurations. That\n"
"estimate depends on the orbital basis in which the Hamiltonian is expressed, and\n"
"*orbital optimization* (OO) exploits this freedom to lower the energy without enlarging\n"
"the subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) approximiert eine Grundzustandsenergie, indem sie\n"
"den Hamiltonian in einem festen Unterraum elektronischer Konfigurationen diagonalisiert. Diese\n"
"Schätzung hängt von der Orbitalbasis ab, in der der Hamiltonian ausgedrückt wird, und die\n"
"*Orbitaloptimierung* (OO) nutzt diese Freiheit, um die Energie zu senken, ohne den Unterraum zu vergrößern.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide runs SQD on an $N_2$ molecule and then improves the result with orbital\n"
"optimization, using [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) to represent\n"
"the Hamiltonian and find the energy-minimizing orbital rotation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Diese Anleitung führt SQD an einem $N_2$-Molekül aus und verbessert das Ergebnis dann mit Orbitaloptimierung, wobei [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) verwendet wird, um\n"
"den Hamiltonian darzustellen und die energieminimierende Orbitalrotation zu finden.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run SQD {#run-sqd}"
msgstr "SQD ausführen {#run-sqd}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We build the molecular integrals for $N_2$ in the molecular-orbital (MO) basis, generate\n"
"uniform random samples, and run SQD to obtain a ground-state approximation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wir erstellen die molekularen Integrale für $N_2$ in der Molekülorbital-Basis (MO), erzeugen\n"
"gleichverteilte Zufalls-Samples und führen SQD aus, um eine Grundzustandsnäherung zu erhalten.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize the orbitals {#optimize-the-orbitals}"
msgstr "Die Orbitale optimieren {#optimize-the-orbitals}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orbital optimization searches for an orbital rotation that lowers the variational energy\n"
msgstr "Die Orbitaloptimierung sucht nach einer Orbitalrotation, die die variationelle Energie\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"of the SQD ground-state approximation $|\\psi\\rangle$. An orbital rotation is specified by\n"
"an $N \\times N$ unitary matrix $\\mathbf{U}$ ($N$ is the number of spatial orbitals), which\n"
"acts on the many-body state through the operator\n"
msgstr ""
"der SQD-Grundzustandsnäherung $|\\psi\\rangle$ senkt. Eine Orbitalrotation wird durch\n"
"eine unitäre $N \\times N$-Matrix $\\mathbf{U}$ angegeben ($N$ ist die Anzahl der räumlichen Orbitale), die\n"
"über den Operator auf den Vielteilchenzustand wirkt\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the **matrix** $\\mathbf{U}$, and applying it to the\n"
"orbital basis (via `hamiltonian.rotated`) is equivalent to applying $\\mathcal{U}$ to the\n"
"state. See the\n"
"[ffsim orbital-rotation explanation](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html)\n"
"for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ffsim.optimize_orbitals` gibt die **Matrix** $\\mathbf{U}$ zurück, und ihre Anwendung auf die\n"
"Orbitalbasis (über `hamiltonian.rotated`) ist gleichbedeutend mit der Anwendung von $\\mathcal{U}$ auf den\n"
"Zustand. Details findest du in der\n"
"[ffsim-Erklärung zur Orbitalrotation](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since rotating the orbitals changes the Hamiltonian seen by the subspace, we alternate\n"
"two steps until the energy stops improving:\n"
msgstr ""
"Da das Rotieren der Orbitale den Hamiltonian verändert, den der Unterraum sieht, wechseln wir\n"
"zwei Schritte ab, bis sich die Energie nicht mehr verbessert:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalize** the Hamiltonian in the current basis over the fixed set of\n"
"configurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Diagonalisiere** den Hamiltonian in der aktuellen Basis über der festen Menge von\n"
"Konfigurationen.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimize the orbitals** by finding the rotation that minimizes the energy of the\n"
"resulting state, then rotate the integrals into the new basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Optimiere die Orbitale**, indem du die Rotation findest, die die Energie des\n"
"resultierenden Zustands minimiert, und rotiere dann die Integrale in die neue Basis.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We delegate the orbital-rotation step to\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"which finds the energy-minimizing rotation from the one- and two-body reduced density\n"
"matrices (RDMs) of the state. See\n"
"[Sec. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den Schritt der Orbitalrotation überlassen wir\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"welches die energieminimierende Rotation aus den Ein- und Zweikörper-reduzierten Dichtematrizen\n"
"(RDMs) des Zustands findet. Details siehe\n"
"[Abschn. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why orbital optimization helps here {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"
msgstr "Warum Orbitaloptimierung hier hilft {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SCF molecular-orbital (MO) basis is stationary with respect to orbital rotations\n"
"for the *full*-CI problem. But SQD works in a small truncated subspace (here a few\n"
"hundred CI strings out of roughly 19 million full-CI determinants), for which the MO\n"
"basis is generally not optimal, so rotating the orbitals lowers the energy the subspace\n"
"can represent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die SCF-Molekülorbital-Basis (MO) ist stationär gegenüber Orbitalrotationen\n"
"für das *volle* CI-Problem. SQD arbeitet jedoch in einem kleinen, abgeschnittenen Unterraum (hier einige\n"
"hundert CI-Strings von etwa 19 Millionen Full-CI-Determinanten), für den die MO-Basis\n"
"im Allgemeinen nicht optimal ist, sodass das Rotieren der Orbitale die Energie senkt, die der Unterraum\n"
"darstellen kann.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternate diagonalization and orbital optimization {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"
msgstr "Diagonalisierung und Orbitaloptimierung abwechseln {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We keep the diagonalization subspace **fixed** to the configurations discovered by SQD\n"
"above, so that each iteration isolates the effect of rotating the orbitals. Each\n"
"iteration:\n"
msgstr ""
"Wir halten den Diagonalisierungs-Unterraum **fest** bei den Konfigurationen, die SQD\n"
"oben gefunden hat, sodass jede Iteration die Wirkung der Orbitalrotation isoliert. Jede\n"
"Iteration:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalizes** the Hamiltonian over the fixed subspace in the current basis, using\n"
"PySCF's selected-CI solver.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Diagonalisiert** den Hamiltonian über dem festen Unterraum in der aktuellen Basis mit\n"
"PySCFs Selected-CI-Solver.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Builds the RDMs** of the resulting state, which is all `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`\n"
"needs.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Erstellt die RDMs** des resultierenden Zustands, was alles ist, was `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`\n"
"benötigt.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimizes the orbitals**: `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the energy-minimizing\n"
"rotation, which we apply to the integrals to move into the improved basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Optimiert die Orbitale**: `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` gibt die energieminimierende\n"
"Rotation zurück, die wir auf die Integrale anwenden, um in die verbesserte Basis zu wechseln.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We record the energy *before* each optimization step. Because the basis improves every\n"
"iteration, this sequence decreases monotonically toward the best energy achievable in\n"
"the fixed subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wir erfassen die Energie *vor* jedem Optimierungsschritt. Da sich die Basis in jeder\n"
"Iteration verbessert, nimmt diese Folge monoton ab und nähert sich der besten Energie, die im\n"
"festen Unterraum erreichbar ist.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the results {#compare-the-results}"
msgstr "Die Ergebnisse vergleichen {#compare-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orbital optimization improves the fixed-subspace estimate, closing much of the gap to\n"
"the exact energy while staying above it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Orbitaloptimierung verbessert die Schätzung im festen Unterraum und schließt einen Großteil der Lücke zur\n"
"exakten Energie, bleibt dabei aber oberhalb von ihr.\n"
